blocking":0},"body":"with the new ActiveAdmin::Reloader I experience no reloading of changed files, eg. files matching /app/admin/*.rb \n\nI added this initializer to my app, to get the proper reloading behavior, for quick fix.\n\n``` ruby\nif Rails.env == \"development\"\n  activeadmin_reloader = ActiveSupport::FileUpdateChecker.new(Dir[\"app/admin/**/*\"], true) do\n\n    ActiveAdmin.application.unload!\n    Rails.application.reload_routes!\n  end\n\n  ActionDispatch::Callbacks.to_prepare do\n    activeadmin_reloader.execute_if_updated\n  end\nend\n```\n\ndid someone else got this behavior?\nI've tried with a existing and new rails 3.1.1 app .. \n","closed_by":{"login":"gregbell","id":719,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/719?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregbell","html_url":"https://github.com/gregbell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregbell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregbell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregbell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregbell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregbell/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregbell/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregbell/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregbell/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregbell/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/activeadmin/activeadmin/issues/707/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/activeadmin/activeadmin/issues/707/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}